
>> animal := Ikintu gishya. 
 
 animal bigeze: ['name:'] kora: { :n
icyacyo izina := n.
}. 


animal name: ['Diva']. 
 
animal bigeze: ['izina'] kora: { <- izina.
}.

>> cat := animal gishya.
 
 cat name: ['Diva']. 
 
 cat bigeze: ['izina'] kora: { <- ['your royal highness ']
+ (ubwacyo izina).
}.

Ibisohoka andika: cat izina.
